  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Any general point on the line is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/5132274c-5be3-4e87-b733-a8162de35dec.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 236px; height: 120px;\" /><br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&gt;</mo></math><br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo></math><br />From the diagram,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>14</mn><msup><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Coordinates of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> or <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>19</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Least value of <math><mn>7</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn></math></p>",
